{"172420":{"value":{"Media":{"averageScore":87,"characters":{"edges":[{"id":464437,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":5,"month":3},"description":"Always chasing shadows... Quite the mysterious Umamusume.\n\nA mysterious girl who blends in with the shadows... and speaks with them. She can often be found sticking close to the walls, tracing odd patterns with her fingertips. According to her, however, she's always with her \"friend.\" She enjoys sipping a nice cup of coffee, as gulping it down too quickly hurts her stomach.","gender":"Female","id":264845,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b264845-8QFSJMCGXiKM.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Manhattan Cafe","native":"マンハッタンカフェ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/264845"},"role":"MAIN"},{"id":464438,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":13,"month":4},"description":"__Height:__ 159 cm\n\nA mad scientist who fears no law. Weaknesses of the flesh can be overcome!\n\nEqual parts researcher and runner, Agnes Tachyon pursues the limits of speed with the power of science. She will stop at nothing to quench her pure thirst for knowledge, performing all manner of experiments on living subjects—unauthorized, dangerous experiments, at that. Her extreme tunnel vision means that without someone to support her, day-to-day necessities quickly fall by the wayside. \n\nA super genius horse girl who’s one of the smartest horse girls of her time. Because of her great intellect, she’s never had to reveal her maximum ability. Thus her true skills are still unknown. Her personality is logical, intelligent, and eccentric. She’s not at all malicious, and in fact has a jovial, playful disposition. She has an Ultimate Super Ultra Sweet Tooth. She’s constantly eating sugar to keep her grey matter full of energy. ~!After beating Jungle Pocket in the Satsuki Sho she announced her indefinite retirement due to a foot injury that she refused to reveal. Her goal was to surpass all limits of the Uma Musume and see how far she could go but since she believed she could not run anymore she decided to leave that goal to the other Uma Musume who can still run. Eventually, after witnessing Jungle Pocket's victory against T.M. Opera O in the Japan Cup, she would go running once again to pursue and achieve her goal by herself.!~","gender":"Female","id":235974,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b235974-cneziP6JuaiT.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Superluminal Princess"],"full":"Agnes Tachyon","native":"アグネスタキオン"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/235974"},"role":"MAIN"},{"id":464439,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":7,"month":5},"description":"__Height:__ 158 cm\n\nJungle Pocket is a bold and charismatic girl who is known for her wild energy, loud voice, and rough personality. She used to be the leader of a group of ruffians in the world of freestyle racing, but was so awestruck by [Fuji Kiseki](https://anilist.co/character/140847/Fuji-Kiseki)'s running that decided she wanted to race officially. With Fuji as her senior and [Agnes Tachyon](https://anilist.co/character/235974/Agnes-Tachyon) as her rival, she aims to be the strongest horse girl of the new era. ~!After losing against Agnes Tachyon in the Satsuki Sho she developed an imposter syndrome where she kept having doubts about herself and how she never beat Agnes Tachyon, concluding she was a fraud. Later on, Fuji Kiseki notices all of her doubts and challenges her to run against her. With this race that she proclaimed having lost, she remembers once again why she wanted to run in the first place. With this new determination inherited from Fuij Kiseki, she finally found the courage to beat her own fears, claiming victory agains T.M. Opera O in the Japan Cup.!~","gender":"Female","id":322150,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b322150-aM4DRsznuzzK.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Jungle Pocket","native":"ジャングルポケット"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/322150"},"role":"MAIN"},{"id":474122,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":19,"month":4},"description":"__Height:__ 163 cm\n\nDantsu Flame is a good-natured Umamusume who often goes along with the whims of others. Although not extremely confident in herself, she works very hard in the hopes that she can run in races forever. Because she can be easily swayed, she is usually pushed around by her unique peers. She is good friends with [Jungle Pocket](https://anilist.co/character/322150/Jungle-Pocket).","gender":"Female","id":327943,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b327943-rAuLOl79CiYB.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Dantsu Flame","native":"ダンツフレーム"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/327943"},"role":"MAIN"},{"id":478907,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"gender":"Male","id":330959,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b330959-dUY1AXG1Q6Dz.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Tanabe Trainer","native":"タナベトレーナー"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/330959"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":543015,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":26,"month":2},"description":"__Height__: 168 cm\n\nAlways takes the logical approach! A brilliant but eccentric racer..\n\nA rebel who only trusts the data she has collected. If she is winning a race, it is due entirely to her calculations and is never due to chance. No matter how many times she's calculated it, she comes up seven centimeters short of winning the Triple Crown, and is currently searching for any possible error in her calculations to prove that it can be done.","gender":"Female","id":286919,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b286919-6HxvWoglMCZ7.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Air Shakur","native":"エアシャカール"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/286919"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":543023,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":27,"month":3},"description":"__Height:__ 167 cm\n\nOguri Cap is a horse girl that always has a serious expression on her face. \n\nA country horse girl hailing from Kasamatsu. She is a gourmand as she is always seen eating large proportions of food. Despite her serious nature, she is quite naive, honest and not often paying much attention to the atmosphere around her. Her dedication is strong when it comes to food and races.","gender":"Female","id":96114,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b96114-uqnjPK9012rB.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Gray Monster","Idol Horse","Oguri Kyappu","오구리 캡"],"full":"Oguri Cap","native":"オグリキャップ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/96114"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":478908,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"gender":"Female","id":330958,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b330958-XtVmHnqlJPu2.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Nana Izumoto","native":"泉本奈々"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/330958"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":543016,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":16,"month":4},"description":"__Height:__ 158 cm\n\nGold City is a racer in the Twinkle Series who is known as a beauty which comes once ever 100 years. She is a charismatic model who draws attention wherever she goes.","gender":"Female","id":174854,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174854-gpkBsrDRa6Yu.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Gold City","native":"ゴールドシチー"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/174854"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":478909,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"gender":"Female","id":330960,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b330960-DLYKDA6VVlb7.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Ruu","native":"ルー"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/330960"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":543017,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":15,"month":5},"description":"**Height:** 143 cm\n\nI love Umamusume! A super versatile otaku.\n\nA veritable Umamusume otaku. She came to Tracen Academy to be close to all of her favorite runners. She does respect boundaries, however, and tries to stay out of trouble. She's eager to get up close and personal with as many Umamusume as possible, and to that end she has revealed surprising ability on both dirt and turf.","gender":"Female","id":295207,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b295207-CZ2FpBhfrYKX.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Digitan"],"full":"Agnes Digital","native":"アグネスデジタル"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/295207"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":543025,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":31,"month":3},"description":"__Height:__ 155 cm\n\nA shining star of pure cuteness! I need lots of love and attention, okay?\n\nWhen you think of \"cute,\" you think of Curren Chan, and when you think of Curren Chan, you think of the selfie goddess boasting over 3 million followers on Umastagram. Realizing just how adorable she was from the moment she was born, she's used her natural charm to bend her parents and seniors alike to her whims. Thanks to that, she is able to climb the social ladder of life with ease. To show everyone just how cute she is, she now aims for the top of the Twinkle Series.","gender":"Female","id":299280,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b299280-JR40j9yvV4EZ.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Curren Chan","native":"カレンチャン"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/299280"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":478910,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"gender":"Female","id":330962,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b330962-hem4vMBHqtT5.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Shima","native":"シマ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/330962"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":543018,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":5,"month":3},"description":"__Height:__ 145 cm\n\nShe is a timid and shy horse girl who believes that any misfortune that occurs around her is her fault. In actuality, she just happens to walk in at the exact time something goes awry but she is completely convinced that she causes terrible incidents and tries to make up for it no matter how she can. Regardless of her own intentions, she was perceived as a villain due to unfortunate circumstances during her childhood that were outside of her control. Despite this misfortune, her personality is honest and pure. Though destiny has played a cruel joke on her, she's a strong, beautiful girl who fights with all her strength.","gender":"Female","id":205736,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b205736-czNHCYh48fIc.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Record-Breaking Black Assassin"],"full":"Rice Shower","native":"ライスシャワー"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/205736"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":478903,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":15,"month":4},"description":"__Height:__ 168 cm\n\nA dashing performer who never hesitates to take another runner gently by the hand. You won't catch her flirting, however. Instead, she helps her dear ponies in her capacity as leader of Ritto Dormitory. As a runner, she hopes to captivate audiences just like her mother, a stage actress. Her ultimate stage: the Triple Crown. \n\nIn Seasons 1-3, she is affiliated with Team Rigil.\n\nIn The Beginning of the New Era, she trusts [Tanabe](https://anilist.co/character/330959/Tanabe-Trainer)'s skills as a trainer more than anyone else. ","gender":"Female","id":140847,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140847-q56xUfctlT9f.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Fuji Kiseki","native":"フジキセキ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/140847"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":478911,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"gender":"Female","id":330961,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b330961-f9fF3xGgHv2t.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Mai"],"full":"Mei","native":"メイ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/330961"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":543019,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":13,"month":5},"description":"__Height:__ 163 cm\n\nShe is an idol recognized by everyone as her bright and gentle personality warms up others. But what is truly inside is a competitive and prideful perfectionist that hates losing. She concerns about her appearance and often complains about [Vodka](https://anilist.co/character/125304/Vodka), who she refers to as a ruffian.","gender":"Female","id":125301,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b125301-8Di5MojIiCLP.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Daiwa Scarlet","native":"ダイワスカーレット"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/125301"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":565326,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":16,"month":3},"description":"**Height:** 156cm\n\nA miraculous sign of gratitude. A kind and gentle Umamusume.\n\nShe's a kind-hearted Umamusume, with a calm and refreshing personality. She has a strong desire to \"pay back those who saved her\", perhaps from her experience of miraculously surviving two near-death experiences in the past. Despite her gentle attitude, she's willing to put her body on the line when it comes to racing. Because of everyone that has supported her, she's prepared to give everything she has everyday. ","gender":"Female","id":392068,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b392068-k4YZfZAcyqhy.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"K.S. Miracle","native":"ケイエスミラクル"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/392068"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":478904,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":4,"month":4},"description":"__Height:__ 166 cm\n\nAn energetic honor student! ...But also kind of a supporting character?\n\nA spirited competitor practically overflowing with positive energy. She wants nothing more than to meet the expectations of her fans and is determined to surmount any challenge to do so. Her willingness to acknowledge and compliment her competitors' strengths has earned her the popularity and respect of her peers. Though she has the makings of a star, she often seems to find herself in more of a supporting role. ","gender":"Female","id":273332,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b273332-rw99HpgzbaEv.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["TopRo"],"full":"Narita Top Road","native":"ナリタトップロード"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/273332"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":543012,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":4,"month":2},"description":"__Height:__ 157 cm (5'2\")\n\nYou'll never catch her looking basic! Modern and stylish! ☆\n\nA trendy city girl who dislikes wasting effort for the sake of the status quo. She'll often attempt to escape difficult situations by claiming she's too stupid to understand what's going on, but she is fully capable of applying herself when she wants to. She once fell into a serious slump because one of her nails broke, so she's been taking care to paint and maintain them ever sense. As she has great communication skills, she has quite a lot of friends. ","gender":"Female","id":298751,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b298751-JD25Kw70nFlc.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Tosen Jordan","native":"トーセンジョーダン"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/298751"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":543020,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":10,"month":3},"description":"__Height__: 156 cm\n\nShe's gonna be a real city girl! Just a hardwork'n girl from the country.\n\nA simple girl from the Iwate countryside, she would often lend a hand on the family farm. Yet despite her humble country background, her true desire is to be a cosmopolitan city girl and compete in the Twinkle Series. Her rural northern upbringing has made her a sincere Umamusume who doesn't back down from a challenge. She sees Gold City as that very ideal. ","gender":"Female","id":286909,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b286909-ip7KICEP3RAa.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Yukino Bijin","native":"ユキノビジン"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/286909"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":478905,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":13,"month":3},"description":"__Height:__ 156 cm\n\nA member of Team Rigil as well as rival to [Narita Top Road ](https://anilist.co/character/273332/Narita-Top-Road) and [Admire Vega ](https://anilist.co/character/273331/Admire-Vega).\n\nOpera O's behavior is always over-exaggerated, sometimes loudly, and you will often hear her proclaiming her greatness in some way or other. She seriously believes that those who do not know their own beauty and strength are unhappy, and she works tirelessly every day to enlighten them. She's friends with and admired by [Meisho Doto ](https://anilist.co/character/211557/Meishou-Dotou).","gender":"Female","id":140845,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140845-BT4Q3o93CM1u.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Supreme Ruler of the Century's End","Overlord","Conqueror","Opera O","티엠 오페라 오"],"full":"T.M. Opera O","native":"テイエムオペラオー"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/140845"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":543013,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":27,"month":2},"description":"__Height:__ 140 cm\n\nAn energetic girl with unending optimism and fighting spirit despite never having won a single race. She brightens up everyday life in the academy and is a friend of Special Week along with many other horse girls. She travels around often to compete in races, and although she has never returned with a single victory, she returns with souvenirs for her friends.\n\nShe does not have a unique idol outfit like the others because she had never won a race.\n\nShe is based on the internationally-famed racehorse of the same name with a record of 0 wins and 113 losses.","gender":"Female","id":211768,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b211768-xdQZ0DeCRaB4.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Haru Urara","native":"ハルウララ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/211768"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":543021,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":12,"month":3},"description":"__Height:__ 157 cm\n\nThe lone star that shines brightest. She carries the weight of her immense resolve.\n\nA somewhat gloomy Umamusume who tends to avoid company. A certain tragedy that took place early in her life affects her deeply, even making her racing activities seem like an attempt to atone. Though she doesn't intend it, her stoic pessimism garners the interest and concern of those around her, and she often gets caught up in the antics of T.M. Opera O, one of her racing peers. \n\n~!It's heavily implied that she lost her sister.!~","gender":"Female","id":273331,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b273331-FpxgETgYKOql.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Ayabe"],"full":"Admire Vega","native":"アドマイヤベガ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/273331"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":478906,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":25,"month":3},"description":"__Height:__ 164 cm\n\nHer self-esteem droops as low as her ears. Things never seem to go quite right for this clumsy girl. Even so, she's determined to change herself for the better and doesn't want to ever give up, all for the chance at securing a brighter future. She admires [T.M. Opera O](https://anilist.co/character/140845/TM-Opera-O)'s grandiose self-confidence.","gender":"Female","id":211557,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b211557-MqJOX0kX06zf.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Meisho Doto"],"full":"Meishou Dotou","native":"メイショウドトウ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/211557"},"role":"SUPPORTING"}]},"description":"\u003cb\u003eREACH OUT AND GRASP GREATNESS.\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nJungle Pocket, known to her close friends as \"Pokke,\" is a free-spirited Umamusume who has proven her dominance in the freestyle racing scene. Overwhelmed by Fuji Kiseki's majestic performance at a graded Twinkle Series race, she resolves to take on the Twinkle Series herself.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nShortly after joining the Umamusume training school Tracen Academy, Pokke comes under the wing of Tanabe, a veteran trainer who fostered Fuji Kiseki's talent. Together, they aspire to dominate the Triple Crown series, a set of three races that can only be attempted once in a lifetime. Awaiting them are formidable rivals of Pokke's generation, whose talents surpass even her own.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThere's Dantsu Flame, whose diligence and determination to win are second to none; Manhattan Cafe, who chases the shadowy silhouette of a \"friend\" that only she can see; and Agnes Tachyon, a veritable mad scientist seeking to push the very boundaries of what is possible for Umamusume.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThese four runners take to the track with their very pride, spirit, and souls on the line. Past the finish of their epic clash is a door waiting to be opened—one that leads to the beginning of a new era.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003e\"It doesn't matter who stands in my way! I'm gonna be the greatest!\"\u003c/i\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Beginning of a New Era Site)","duration":108,"endDate":{"day":24,"month":5,"year":2024},"genres":["Drama","Psychological","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":172420,"meanScore":87,"popularity":29156,"rankings":[{"allTime":true,"context":"highest rated all time","format":"MOVIE","rank":8,"type":"RATED"},{"allTime":true,"context":"most popular all time","format":"MOVIE","rank":275,"type":"POPULAR"},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"MOVIE","rank":1,"type":"RATED","year":2024},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"MOVIE","rank":6,"type":"POPULAR","year":2024}],"recommendations":{"edges":[{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/180516-qxKVBsTW6Czx.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#1aa1d6","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx180516-lebpoKLkw6E3.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx180516-lebpoKLkw6E3.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx180516-lebpoKLkw6E3.jpg"},"description":"Unbeknownst to those around her in the destitute countryside of Kasamatsu, the staggering potential of this ashen-haired \"Beast” will soon rock Japan with her feet and catapult her to the national stage—down the path of a legend. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nFollow Oguri Cap and her insatiable appetite as the starting gates open on this Umamusume's hot-blooded Cinderella story! \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n(Source: It's Anime powered by REMOW, edited)","episodes":13,"format":"TV","id":180516,"idMal":59636,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":85,"season":"SPRING","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/180516","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Umamusume: Cinderella Gray","native":"ウマ娘 シンデレラグレイ","romaji":"Uma Musume: Cinderella Gray","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Cinderella Gray"},"trailer":{"id":"Gw8j8-m1gVk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Gw8j8-m1gVk/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/148370-rYivpA9giZYc.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#5086fe","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx148370-db0LjJfaOCg9.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx148370-db0LjJfaOCg9.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx148370-db0LjJfaOCg9.jpg"},"description":"The new anime will depict T.M. Opera O, Admire Vega, Narita Top Road, and other Uma Musume (Horse Girls) going head-to-head to win Classic competitions.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","episodes":4,"format":"ONA","id":148370,"idMal":51761,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":80,"season":"SPRING","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/148370","startDate":{"day":16,"month":4,"year":2023},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー ROAD TO THE TOP","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top"},"trailer":{"id":"SQ7rv98fgH4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SQ7rv98fgH4/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/124223-BY20WcVyVHEA.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#5d93e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx124223-XMOEUPopjtrI.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx124223-XMOEUPopjtrI.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx124223-XMOEUPopjtrI.png"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eUma Musume: Pretty Derby\u003c/i\u003e.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nAll eyes are on Toukai Teiou as she takes on the Japanese Derby, ready to gallop in Symboli Rudolf's footsteps and become an undefeated Triple Crown Horse Girl. The stands are full. The track is set. It's time to see which horse girl fortune favors!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll, edited)","episodes":13,"format":"TV","id":124223,"idMal":42941,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":83,"season":"WINTER","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/124223","startDate":{"day":5,"month":1,"year":2021},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby Season 2","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー Season 2","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby Season 2","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"1y77CeQmnD8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1y77CeQmnD8/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/195240-HcuZvXcdT5aX.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#5093e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx195240-hKcmllV6YHQT.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx195240-hKcmllV6YHQT.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx195240-hKcmllV6YHQT.jpg"},"description":"The second half of \u003ci\u003eUmamusume: Cinderella Gray\u003c/i\u003e. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nHailing from the humble countryside, Oguri Cap has turned the racing world on its head. Her rampage through the national race scene seemed unstoppable... until it wasn't. Tamamo Cross, the current peak of racing, has bested the Beast and declared Oguri Cap her rival. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nBut Oguri Cap can't afford to keep her attention on Tamamo Cross alone. One by one, racers from all over the world arrive in Japan, ready to demonstrate their own prowess. Up against the best the world has to offer, our ashen racer will need to reach beyond her limits if she wants to stand a chance… Keep those eyes peeled—a Cinderella story full of twists and turns lies ahead!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n(Source: It's Anime powered by REMOW)\n","episodes":10,"format":"TV","id":195240,"idMal":61930,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":86,"season":"FALL","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/195240","startDate":{"day":5,"month":10,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Umamusume: Cinderella Gray 2nd Cour","native":"ウマ娘 シンデレラグレイ 第2クール","romaji":"Uma Musume: Cinderella Gray Part 2","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Cinderella Gray 2nd Cour"},"trailer":{"id":"MNZchQvbMa0","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MNZchQvbMa0/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/113024-gjxwISIts05f.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#e45d50","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx113024-OdzOh0OKFPTN.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx113024-OdzOh0OKFPTN.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx113024-OdzOh0OKFPTN.png"},"description":"The stage emulates life and compresses it, setting free skills learned over lifetimes in brief but dazzling displays for the amusement and judgment of others. For the performers, it is the ultimate risk, and some will rise while others must fall. Nowhere is this truer than at the Seisho Music Academy, where music, dance and real weapons all come into play in the creation of the next great Star. Karen and Hikari’s destinies have been linked since a childhood promise, but their journeys here have taken very different paths. Now, after Hikari leaves, Karen must discover who she is without her opposite, while Hikari must rediscover her own course.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","id":113024,"idMal":40664,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":87,"season":"SPRING","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/113024","startDate":{"day":4,"month":6,"year":2021},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Revue Starlight: The Movie","native":"劇場版 少女☆歌劇 レヴュースタァライト","romaji":"Shoujo☆Kageki Revue Starlight Movie","userPreferred":"Revue Starlight: The Movie"},"trailer":{"id":"576xjJdDBNg","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/576xjJdDBNg/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/177687-24ePtQwAUb7n.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#e46b5d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx177687-T4SrtVjrmW01.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx177687-T4SrtVjrmW01.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx177687-T4SrtVjrmW01.png"},"description":"\u003ci\u003e100 METERS\u003c/i\u003e follows Togashi, a track star who is born to run. As a kid, he is naturally gifted and wins every 100-meter race without effort. But in sixth grade, he meets Komiya, a transfer student who is full of determination but lacks technique. In teaching him, Togashi gives Komiya a new purpose: to win no matter what. Years pass by, and Togashi and Komiya meet again as rivals on the track and reveal their true selves.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: GKIDS)","episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","id":177687,"idMal":58919,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":83,"season":"SUMMER","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/177687","startDate":{"day":19,"month":9,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"100 METERS","native":"ひゃくえむ。","romaji":"Hyakuemu.","userPreferred":"100 METERS"},"trailer":{"id":"oXeYSCXSFhs","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/oXeYSCXSFhs/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/2402-SgRt5yp35i1Y.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#e46b43","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx2402-hbo1SbfcM5hm.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx2402-hbo1SbfcM5hm.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx2402-hbo1SbfcM5hm.jpg"},"description":"Joe, a teenage orphan in the slums of the Doya streets, meets Danpei, a homeless, alcoholic ex-boxing coach. Danpei, seeing Joe's boxing talent, decides to train him. When Joe is sent to a terrible juvenile home for petty crimes, he meets Rikiishi who becomes his boxing rival. Danpei arrives at the home to help Joe to train in order to defeat Rikiishi. When Joe decides to seriously pursue boxing, Danpei cannot get a coaching license because of his reputation as a drunk. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: AnimeNfo)","episodes":79,"format":"TV","id":2402,"idMal":2402,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":81,"season":"SPRING","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/2402","startDate":{"day":1,"month":4,"year":1970},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Tomorrow's Joe","native":"あしたのジョー","romaji":"Ashita no Joe","userPreferred":"Tomorrow's Joe"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20607-AYghLMjh7reA.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#e47843","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20607-fIOxVISIl0HY.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20607-fIOxVISIl0HY.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20607-fIOxVISIl0HY.jpg"},"description":"Tsukimoto Makoto (nicknamed Smile) is a quiet high-schooler who's been friends with the loud and energetic Hoshino Yukata (nicknamed Peko). They're both in the table tennis club and are very good at it, though Smile's personality prevents him from winning against Peko. The club teacher however notices Smile's talent and tries to make him gain some sportive tenacity.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","episodes":11,"format":"TV","id":20607,"idMal":22135,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":86,"season":"SPRING","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/20607","startDate":{"day":11,"month":4,"year":2014},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Ping Pong the Animation","native":"ピンポン THE ANIMATION","romaji":"Ping Pong THE ANIMATION","userPreferred":"Ping Pong the Animation"},"trailer":{"id":"lmZVuMDlw-w","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/lmZVuMDlw-w/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}}]},"relations":{"edges":[{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/98514-0uYzay4a1iiL.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e47850","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx98514-mEh3Gl58AWgc.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx98514-mEh3Gl58AWgc.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx98514-mEh3Gl58AWgc.jpg"},"description":"In a world very much like our own, great race horses of the past have a chance to be reborn as \"horse girls\"—girls with the ears and tails of horses as well as their speed and endurance. The best of these horse girls go to train at Tokyo's Tracen Academy, hopefully moving on to fame and fortune as both racers and idols.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nSpecial Week, a high school horse girl from the countryside, has just transferred to Tracen, and she's determined to fulfill her promise to her mother to become the best horse girl in Japan. On her way to school, she takes a pit stop at the race track and instantly falls in love with Silence Suzuka's style, becoming determined to race on the same team as her.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network) ","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":18,"month":6,"year":2018},"episodes":13,"format":"TV","genres":["Drama","Music","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":98514,"idMal":35249,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2018,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/98514","startDate":{"day":2,"month":4,"year":2018},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["สาวม้าโมเอะ"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby"},"trailer":{"id":"WlDbeKNVtBo","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WlDbeKNVtBo/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"PARENT"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/148370-rYivpA9giZYc.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5086fe","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx148370-db0LjJfaOCg9.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx148370-db0LjJfaOCg9.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx148370-db0LjJfaOCg9.jpg"},"description":"The new anime will depict T.M. Opera O, Admire Vega, Narita Top Road, and other Uma Musume (Horse Girls) going head-to-head to win Classic competitions.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Anime News Network)","duration":25,"endDate":{"day":7,"month":5,"year":2023},"episodes":4,"format":"ONA","genres":["Drama","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":148370,"idMal":51761,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":80,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2023,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/148370","startDate":{"day":16,"month":4,"year":2023},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top","ウマ娘ロードトゥーザトップ","Uma Musume: Pretty Derby RTTT"],"title":{"english":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top","native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー ROAD TO THE TOP","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP","userPreferred":"Umamusume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top"},"trailer":{"id":"SQ7rv98fgH4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SQ7rv98fgH4/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"PREQUEL"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/176299-dtVaXMPJWVrF.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5d86e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx176299-9LocW6ylWFhm.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx176299-9LocW6ylWFhm.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx176299-9LocW6ylWFhm.jpg"},"description":"Theatrical version of \u003ci\u003eUma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP\u003c/i\u003e which includes new extra scenes.","duration":99,"endDate":{"day":10,"month":5,"year":2024},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Drama","Slice of Life","Sports"],"id":176299,"idMal":58517,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/176299","startDate":{"day":10,"month":5,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["ウマ娘ロードトゥーザトップ","Uma Musume: Pretty Derby RTTT"],"title":{"native":"ウマ娘 プリティーダービー ROAD TO THE TOP 劇場用再編集版","romaji":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP Movie","userPreferred":"Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - ROAD TO THE TOP Movie"},"trailer":{"id":"ka62Zuurh-c","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ka62Zuurh-c/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"PREQUEL"}]},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/172420","staff":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":126549,"name":{"full":"Cygames"}},"role":"Original Creator"},{"node":{"id":136052,"name":{"full":"Ken Yamamoto"}},"role":"Director"},{"node":{"id":119867,"name":{"full":"Jun Yamazaki"}},"role":"Character Design"},{"node":{"id":183840,"name":{"full":"Odashi"}},"role":"Prop Design"},{"node":{"id":175977,"name":{"full":"Yuusuke Watanabe"}},"role":"Art Director"},{"node":{"id":152914,"name":{"full":"You Iwaida"}},"role":"Color Design"},{"node":{"id":135989,"name":{"full":"Akane Fushihara"}},"role":"Director of Photography"},{"node":{"id":142140,"name":{"full":"Yuuki Kawashita"}},"role":"Director of Photography"},{"node":{"id":134282,"name":{"full":"Kashiko Kimura"}},"role":"Editing"},{"node":{"id":164154,"name":{"full":"Yoshinori Nakano"}},"role":"CG Director"},{"node":{"id":102194,"name":{"full":"Youta Tsuruoka"}},"role":"Sound Director"},{"node":{"id":102520,"name":{"full":"Masaru Yokoyama"}},"role":"Music"},{"node":{"id":265083,"name":{"full":"Tetsuya Uchida"}},"role":"Music Producer"},{"node":{"id":266819,"name":{"full":"Kan Mizoguchi"}},"role":"Animation Producer"},{"node":{"id":109387,"name":{"full":"Kiyoko Yoshimura"}},"role":"Script"},{"node":{"id":121819,"name":{"full":"Manabu Okamoto"}},"role":"Assistant Unit Director"},{"node":{"id":136052,"name":{"full":"Ken Yamamoto"}},"role":"Storyboard"},{"node":{"id":136625,"name":{"full":"Toshimasa Ishii"}},"role":"Storyboard"},{"node":{"id":119867,"name":{"full":"Jun Yamazaki"}},"role":"Chief Animation Director"},{"node":{"id":136052,"name":{"full":"Ken Yamamoto"}},"role":"Action Animation Director"},{"node":{"id":138361,"name":{"full":"Takahiro Watabe"}},"role":"Action Animation Director"},{"node":{"id":242330,"name":{"full":"Shuuhei Fuchimoto"}},"role":"Action Animation Director"},{"node":{"id":134261,"name":{"full":"Miyachi"}},"role":"Animation Director"},{"node":{"id":136907,"name":{"full":"Masashi Nomura "}},"role":"Animation Director"},{"node":{"id":137936,"name":{"full":"Naoya Nakayama"}},"role":"Animation Director"}]},"startDate":{"day":24,"month":5,"year":2024},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":6182,"name":"CygamesPictures"}]},"trailer":{"id":"h4dMQOzj-5g","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/h4dMQOzj-5g/hqdefault.jpg"}}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T02:27:18.445967082+05:30"},"182300":{"value":{"Media":{"averageScore":82,"characters":{"edges":[{"id":504851,"node":{"age":"16-","dateOfBirth":{"day":24,"month":12},"description":"__Height:__ 168 cm (5'6\")\n__Race:__ Lyzance\n\nWill Serfort is a sixth year student at the Regarden Magical Academy shunned by most students and faculty due to his lack of magical aptitude. To make up for his lack of magic, Will trains his body and swordsmanship in the dungeon.","gender":"Male","id":212394,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212394-LBHoN071nIuu.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Will Serholt"],"full":"Will Serfort","native":"ウィル・セルフォルト"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/212394"},"role":"MAIN"},{"id":514265,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":8,"month":9},"description":"\n\nA female watcher whose true identity remains unknown, even to most people in the Tower. She attends the academy as a student, and when she discovers someone with exceptional talent (especially those who are deemed unworthy by academy standards), she scouts them for the Tower. While at school, she goes by the alias of Iris Churchill. \n\nAlthough she often works behind the scenes, her magical abilities are on par with those of high mages. ","gender":"Female","id":337446,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b337446-63IKi5UuOAv7.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Iris Churchill (アイリス・チャーチル)"],"full":"Iris Stellamaris","native":"アイリス・X・ステラマリス"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/337446"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":571159,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":2,"month":6},"description":"One of the Magia Vende. Leader of the Elf Faction.","gender":"Female","id":337477,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b337477-j0B3N9otRLvq.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Ellenor Ljos Alf","native":"エルノール・リヨス・アールヴ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/337477"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":571303,"node":{"age":"16-","dateOfBirth":{"day":22,"month":1},"description":"__Height:__ 167cm\n\nStudent at Rigarden Magical Academy. He is the announcer for the Great Magic Festival.","gender":"Male","id":343053,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b343053-IDIEHsYloRyU.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Mike Maius","native":"マイク・マイウス"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/343053"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":572833,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Sixth year student at Rigarden Magical Academy.","id":343069,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b343069-mrjABD1xOvtt.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Emma Klever","native":"エマ・クレバー"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/343069"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":514258,"node":{"age":"15-","dateOfBirth":{"day":8,"month":10},"description":"__Race:__ Resans\n__Height:__ 164 cm (5'5\")\n\nOnly daughter of house Loire, a fallen family of nobles. She specializes in earth magic, but struggles considerably with any spell requiring precision. Colette befriended Will following a certain incident during her first year at the academy. ","gender":"Female","id":212586,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212586-v5QG7DMjyVT1.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Colette Loire","native":"コレット・ロワール"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/212586"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":514266,"node":{"age":"16-","dateOfBirth":{"day":24,"month":12},"description":"__Height:__ 163 cm (5'4\")\n__Race:__ Lyzance\n\nA true prodigy and the youngest Magia Vander in history, she watches over a certain young man from her windowsill in the Tower. Those close to her say she is an easygoing Magia Vander who likes to play the saint. [Will's](https://anilist.co/character/212394/Will-Serfort) childhood friend who specializes in ice magic. ","gender":"Female","id":326398,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b326398-OuoqFJgRTk5Q.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Elfaria Alvis Serholt"],"full":"Elfaria Serfort","native":"エルファリア・アルヴィス・セルフォルト"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/326398"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":571160,"node":{"age":"16-","dateOfBirth":{"day":10,"month":7},"description":"__Height:__ 170 cm (5'7\")\n\nA skilled magical artificer and Will's roommate. His boundless affection for Will is enough to make Colette nervous. While lacking any natural gift for artificing, he has become a great talent and often devises various magical items under the pretense of making them for Will.","gender":"Male","id":327989,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b327989-p1ZfQ4BNBA2I.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Rosty Nowman"],"full":"Rosti Naumann","native":"ロスティ・ナウマン"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/327989"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":571304,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Sixth year student at Rigarden Magical Academy, and Colette Loire's roommate. ","gender":"Female","id":341268,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b341268-KKWc2y9bpefI.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Rose Prehnite","native":"ロゼ・プレナイト"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/341268"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":573606,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Adjutant of the fire faction.","gender":"Male","id":337478,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b337478-658usRRj3i9c.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Logwell","native":"ログウェル"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/337478"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":514259,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Will's familiar and pet. Kiki is a carbuncle, capable of casting reflective magic to protect Will in emergencies.","id":327988,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b327988-QItj9NFkZr4q.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Kiki","native":"キキ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/327988"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":514500,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":1,"month":4},"description":"Member of the Finn tribe, who serve as guides in the dungeon. Claims to be forever 7 years old.","id":346657,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b346657-Fki0HJMygo87.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Finn","native":"フィン"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/346657"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":571161,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"gender":"Female","id":396158,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b396158-a8YTbBR03LBm.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Clairie Serah","native":"クレイルウィ・セラ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/396158"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":571305,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Sixth year student at Rigarden Magical Academy.","gender":"Male","id":339973,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b339973-SIeZhEXEPmfA.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Gordon Vally"],"full":"Gordon Baret","native":"ゴードン・バレー"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/339973"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":514260,"node":{"age":"25-","dateOfBirth":{"day":25,"month":12},"description":"__Height:__ 178 cm (5'10)\n\nProfessor of Magizoology. As one of the few people who understands Will, he always worries when Will pushes himself too hard. Though he tends to show his love for his students by being strict with them, this has made him an object of terror at the academy. He has earned various nicknames, including \"Remedial Teacher from Hell,\" \"Four-Eyed Fiend,\" \"Magical Creature Nut,\" and \"Immortal Workner,\" and is feared by friend and foe alike. ","gender":"Male","id":336095,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b336095-mYa5YNguKua6.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Remedial Teacher from Hell","Four-Eyed Fiend","Magical Creature Nut","Immortal Workner"],"full":"Workner Norgram","native":"ワークナー・ノーグラム"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/336095"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":514501,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Member of Gohtia who works with Headless.","id":345923,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b345923-WOJjM9sLSiZF.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Marze","native":"マルゼ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/345923"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":571298,"node":{"age":"27","dateOfBirth":{"day":14,"month":12},"description":"__Height:__ 5'8\"\n__Race:__ Lyzance\n\nIce Faction Aide-de-Camp.","gender":"Female","id":345721,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b345721-IsP6fj5uP1sf.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Sarissa Alfeld","native":"サリサ・アルフェルト"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/345721"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":571306,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Headmaster of Rigarden Magic Academy.","gender":"Female","id":337474,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b337474-irPK1zl5a755.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Caldron Anouve"],"full":"Caldron Anouve","native":"コルドロン・アヌーブ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/337474"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":514261,"node":{"age":"16","dateOfBirth":{"day":23,"month":2},"description":"__Height:__ 174 cm (5'9\")\n\nAn ice mage and one of the top three students in Will's year. He is a typical noble, with pride and self-assurance to spare. Since the incident at the magic festival, he has been forced to work at Gina's bar.","gender":"Male","id":327990,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b327990-3LUKUJxMXXNp.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Julius Reinberg"],"full":"Julius Reinburg","native":"ユリウス・レインバーグ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/327990"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":514502,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"An enemy of humanity who works with the Unknown Assassin.","id":345922,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b345922-5DX7GN24fYf9.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Headless"],"full":"Kubinashi","native":"首無し"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/345922"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":571299,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":20,"month":3},"description":"Elf Faction Aide-de-Camp.","id":343065,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b343065-vnx84pvjefuz.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Lefiya Viridis","native":"レフィーヤ・ウィリディス"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/343065"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":571307,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Sixth year student at Rigarden Magical Academy.","gender":"Male","id":339972,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b339972-WM5861a77TI0.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Lyril Mars"],"full":"Lyril Marze","native":"リリール・マース"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/339972"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":514262,"node":{"age":"26","dateOfBirth":{"day":22,"month":8},"description":"__Height:__ 177 cm (5'9\")\n\nAn ascendant who made it to the top of the Tower, earning the qualification to become Magia Vander, before being defeated by another candidate. He now works as a professor at Regarden Magical Academy, where he teaches Dark Magic and History and Origins of Magic. Ten years ago, he was one of a group of problem children who enlisted to fight in the Great War despite still being students. ","gender":"Male","id":212395,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b212395-i8eVeg9TInDU.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Darkviper Mage"],"full":"Edward Serfence","native":"エドワルド・セルフェンス"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/212395"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":571156,"node":{"age":"75 (approximately 15 in mage years)","dateOfBirth":{"day":1,"month":6},"description":"__Height:__ 176 cm (5'9\")\n\nAn elf who transferred to the academy from Alfswood, located in the far north Urbus region. In accordance with elven customs, he only permits physical contact with those he has deemed worthy. Shares the same dream as a certain no-talent. He specializes in wind and illusion magic.","gender":"Male","id":331144,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b331144-GkojQAjFewPj.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Ignor Lindor"],"full":"Wignall Lindor","native":"イグノール・リンドール"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/331144"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":571300,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Elf Faction Aide-de-Camp.","id":343064,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b343064-XhoWI3q9OeNn.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Filvis Challia","native":"フィルヴィス・シャリア"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/343064"},"role":"SUPPORTING"}]},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eTsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria\u003c/i\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nWill, a washout student at a magical academy who is unable to use magic, is aiming to join the top tier of mages, the Magia Vander, to fulfill a promise to his childhood friend, Elfaria. Wielding a sword instead of a wand, his abilities are slowly recognized within the academy. During the all-student praxis dungeon training he undertakes with Lihanna and the other top students of his year, they are ambushed by a mysterious mage. Though they barely manage to survive the attack together, they go on to face the exit exam. Can Will reach the girl waiting for him in the tower?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Official Site)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":28,"month":6,"year":2026},"genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":182300,"meanScore":82,"popularity":91942,"rankings":[{"allTime":true,"context":"highest rated all time","format":"TV","rank":184,"type":"RATED"},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":10,"type":"RATED","year":2026},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":11,"type":"POPULAR","year":2026},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":2,"season":"SPRING","type":"RATED","year":2026},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":5,"season":"SPRING","type":"POPULAR","year":2026}],"recommendations":{"edges":[{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/97940-1URQdQ4U1a0b.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#d6c96b","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx97940-fyh8o7gNbha0.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx97940-fyh8o7gNbha0.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx97940-fyh8o7gNbha0.png"},"description":"In a world where magic is everything, Asta and Yuno are both found abandoned at a church on the same day. While Yuno is gifted with exceptional magical powers, Asta is the only one in this world without any. At the age of fifteen, both receive grimoires, magic books that amplify their holder’s magic. Asta’s is a rare Grimoire of Anti-Magic that negates and repels his opponent’s spells. Being opposite but good rivals, Yuno and Asta are ready for the hardest of challenges to achieve their common dream: to be the Wizard King. Giving up is never an option!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","episodes":170,"format":"TV","id":97940,"idMal":34572,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"season":"FALL","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/97940","startDate":{"day":3,"month":10,"year":2017},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Black Clover","native":"ブラッククローバー","romaji":"Black Clover","userPreferred":"Black Clover"},"trailer":{"id":"vUjAxk1qYzQ","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/vUjAxk1qYzQ/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/151801-zBFaJMIJFWfS.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#f1bb5d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx151801-XxVf22Le6C8o.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx151801-XxVf22Le6C8o.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx151801-XxVf22Le6C8o.png"},"description":"This is a world of magic. This is a world in which magic is casually used by everyone.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nIn a deep, dark forest in this world of magic, there is a boy who is singlemindedly working out. His name is Mash Burnedead, and he has a secret. He can’t use magic. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nAll he wanted was to live a quiet life with his family, but people suddenly start trying to kill him one day and he somehow finds himself enrolled in Magic School. There, he sets his sights on becoming a “Divine Visionary,” the elite of the elite. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e Will his ripped muscles work against the best and brightest of the wizarding world? The curtain rises on this off-kilter magical fantasy in which the power of being jacked crushes any spell!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","episodes":12,"format":"TV","id":151801,"idMal":52211,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":76,"season":"SPRING","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/151801","startDate":{"day":8,"month":4,"year":2023},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"MASHLE: MAGIC AND MUSCLES","native":"マッシュル-MASHLE-","romaji":"MASHLE","userPreferred":"MASHLE: MAGIC AND MUSCLES"},"trailer":{"id":"zl0Kiv0kuQQ","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/zl0Kiv0kuQQ/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/20920-QZeO1gVTQSUZ.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#aee4d6","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx20920-MTREwZOG4BAD.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx20920-MTREwZOG4BAD.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx20920-MTREwZOG4BAD.jpg"},"description":"Some adventurers delve into the sprawling labyrinths beneath the city of Orario to find fame and fortune. Others come to test their skills against the legions of monsters lurking in the darkness below. However, Bell Cranel’s grandfather told him a different reason: it’s a great place to rescue (and subsequently meet) girls! Now that Bell’s a dungeon delver himself, the ladies he’s encountering aren’t the helpless damsels in distress he’d imagined, and one of them, the beautiful swordswoman Ais Wallenstein, keeps rescuing Bell instead. As embarrassing as that is, it’s nothing compared to what happens when goddesses get involved. Freya, Hephaistos, and Loki, with their powerful Familias, are intimidating enough, but there’s one goddess whose relationship with Bell is certain to spark trouble.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)","episodes":13,"format":"TV","id":20920,"idMal":28121,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"season":"SPRING","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/20920","startDate":{"day":4,"month":4,"year":2015},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?","native":"ダンジョンに出会いを求めるのは間違っているだろうか","romaji":"Dungeon ni Deai wo Motomeru no wa Machigatteiru Darou ka","userPreferred":"Is It Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?"},"trailer":{"id":"sbcwRt0y4kY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/sbcwRt0y4kY/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/179966-hf71VrF1zhPM.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#e4c9ae","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx179966-g0EU7rVe2Og7.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx179966-g0EU7rVe2Og7.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx179966-g0EU7rVe2Og7.jpg"},"description":"Monica Everett, the Silent Witch, is the world’s only practitioner of Voiceless Magic, a veritable heroine who single-handedly fended off the Black Dragon of legend. However, the young prodigy is actually…super-duper shy! Yup, turns out she only learned Voiceless Magic to avoid speaking in public. Ignorant of this, the Seven Sages have placed her on a top-secret mission to guard the Second Prince. Can Monica keep it together as she contends with both social interaction and the evils targeting the young royal?\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e(Source: Yen Press, edited)","episodes":13,"format":"TV","id":179966,"idMal":59459,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":81,"season":"SUMMER","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/179966","startDate":{"day":5,"month":7,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Secrets of the Silent Witch","native":"サイレント・ウィッチ 沈黙の魔女の隠しごと","romaji":"Silent Witch: Chinmoku no Majo no Kakushigoto","userPreferred":"Secrets of the Silent Witch"},"trailer":{"id":"0OBF29HoV4A","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0OBF29HoV4A/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/142598-mNFZbRUAxgFV.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#5d93e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx142598-0jpRK2h0v1hd.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx142598-0jpRK2h0v1hd.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx142598-0jpRK2h0v1hd.jpg"},"description":"It’s springtime at Kimberly Magic Academy, and new students are beginning their first year. Among them are a skilled and studious boy, Oliver, and a headstrong samurai girl, Nanao. They soon form a unique bond in the halls of Kimberly, but this picturesque school isn’t what it seems. Dark secrets and endless danger lurk behind every corner. Can these wizards make it to graduation alive?!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","episodes":15,"format":"TV","id":142598,"idMal":50582,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":64,"season":"SUMMER","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/142598","startDate":{"day":8,"month":7,"year":2023},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Reign of the Seven Spellblades","native":"七つの魔剣が支配する","romaji":"Nanatsu no Maken ga Shihai Suru","userPreferred":"Reign of the Seven Spellblades"},"trailer":{"id":"AQ6lIA3faKc","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/AQ6lIA3faKc/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/130298-9yxFlFvKMwRk.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#d61a1a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx130298-YMdcKHytpWNH.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx130298-YMdcKHytpWNH.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx130298-YMdcKHytpWNH.jpg"},"description":"Some people just aren’t suited to playing the part of the flashy, in-your-face hero or the dastardly, mustache-twirling villain with larger-than-life panache. Instead, they operate in the shadows and pull the strings of society through wit and cleverness. That’s the role Cid wants to play when he’s transported to another world. Cid spins a yarn or three and becomes the unlikely leader of the underground Shadow Garden organization that fights against a menacing cult (which he totally made up). However, there’s a catch even his wild imagination didn’t see coming: the cult he concocted actually exists, and they’re beyond displeased that his power fantasy just got in the way of their evil plans!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: HIDIVE)","episodes":20,"format":"TV","id":130298,"idMal":48316,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":81,"season":"FALL","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/130298","startDate":{"day":5,"month":10,"year":2022},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"The Eminence in Shadow","native":"陰の実力者になりたくて！","romaji":"Kage no Jitsuryokusha ni Naritakute!","userPreferred":"The Eminence in Shadow"},"trailer":{"id":"L7LgAbGF-WY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/L7LgAbGF-WY/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/6702-VSHyctSAeUBS.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#e45d50","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b6702-KI4qgSMyI8Pm.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/b6702-KI4qgSMyI8Pm.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/b6702-KI4qgSMyI8Pm.png"},"description":"Across the Fiore kingdom, wizards join guilds and make their pay by filling magical needs—but one guild has a reputation as the roughest, rowdiest, most dangerous of all: Fairy Tail!\u003cbr\u003e\nWhen four young Fairy Tail members unite, their bond is forged by a power found in neither muscle nor magic and grows stronger with every mission. Whatever you do, don't mess with these friends or you'll get a taste of Natsu's flaming fist or Gray's ice hammer, suffer a painful blow from one of Lucy's celestial spirits or catch the edge of Erza's mighty blade! Whether they're stopping demons from devastating the world or wrestling in the mess hall, this mystical team manages to inflict as much damage to their rivals as they do to the surrounding area!\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Funimation)","episodes":175,"format":"TV","id":6702,"idMal":6702,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":72,"season":"FALL","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/6702","startDate":{"day":12,"month":10,"year":2009},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Fairy Tail","native":"FAIRY TAIL","romaji":"FAIRY TAIL","userPreferred":"Fairy Tail"},"trailer":{"id":"mAAKPx-ndAg","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/mAAKPx-ndAg/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/176292-esCzjSi7cgHj.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#f18635","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx176292-meJTWM8zQjjp.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx176292-meJTWM8zQjjp.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx176292-meJTWM8zQjjp.jpg"},"description":"The second season of \u003ci\u003eNanatsu no Taizai: Mokushiroku no Yonkishi.\u003c/i\u003e","episodes":12,"format":"TV","id":176292,"idMal":58511,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":74,"season":"FALL","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/176292","startDate":{"day":6,"month":10,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"The Seven Deadly Sins: Four Knights of the Apocalypse Season 2","native":"七つの大罪 黙示録の四騎士 第2期","romaji":"Nanatsu no Taizai: Mokushiroku no Yonkishi 2nd Season","userPreferred":"The Seven Deadly Sins: Four Knights of the Apocalypse Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"BpbMeDoYofU","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/BpbMeDoYofU/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}}]},"relations":{"edges":[{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/174576-6stJnscy5rCi.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4865d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx174576-tpKcHG0eO6CS.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx174576-tpKcHG0eO6CS.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx174576-tpKcHG0eO6CS.jpg"},"description":"A hard-working boy named Will enters a magic academy in hopes of becoming a great sorcerer. Unfortunately, there's a fatal flaw in his plan: he lacks the ability to use magic. Amid the cold stares of his classmates and instructors, Will feels discouraged at times, but he presses forward with unwavering determination. He can't use a wand, but he can wield a sword in his battle to reach the top of a magic-dominated world. He just needs to believe in his own unique strengths and remember the promise he made with someone precious to him...\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":29,"month":9,"year":2024},"episodes":12,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":174576,"idMal":58059,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/174576","startDate":{"day":7,"month":7,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["杖與劍的魔劍譚","ตำนานดาบและคทาแห่งวิสตอเรีย","Wistoria: Varinhas e Espadas"],"title":{"english":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword","native":"杖と剣のウィストリア","romaji":"Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria","userPreferred":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword"},"trailer":{"id":"FNiBiXXeyb8","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FNiBiXXeyb8/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"PREQUEL"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/125116-XzHAN4qtk41l.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#0daee4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx125116-ZfCpel1WOdmF.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/bx125116-ZfCpel1WOdmF.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/small/bx125116-ZfCpel1WOdmF.jpg"},"description":"Will Serfort dreams of keeping his promise to a childhood friend by becoming a Magia Vander, one of the mighty magicians who sit atop the Wizard's Tower. However, he is unable to cast even the simplest of spells, leaving him to fight dungeon monsters to earn credits at Regarden Magical Academy. As if that weren't enough, he finds himself putting his sword skills to the test against a bullying professor!\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Kodansha USA)","endDate":{},"format":"MANGA","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":125116,"idMal":131924,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/manga/125116","startDate":{"day":9,"month":12,"year":2020},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["The Wistoria of Staves and Swords","ดาบและคทาแห่งวิสตอเรีย","Wistoria – Zauberstab \u0026 Schwert"],"title":{"english":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword","native":"杖と剣のウィストリア","romaji":"Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria","userPreferred":"Wistoria: Wand and Sword"},"trailer":{"id":"g2l02QKRBJY","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/g2l02QKRBJY/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"MANGA"},"relationType":"SOURCE"}]},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/182300","staff":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":118412,"name":{"full":"Fujino Oomori"}},"role":"Original Story"},{"node":{"id":191990,"name":{"full":"Toshi Aoi"}},"role":"Original Character Design"},{"node":{"id":112047,"name":{"full":"Tatsuya Yoshihara"}},"role":"Chief Director"},{"node":{"id":119347,"name":{"full":"Hideaki Nakano"}},"role":"Director"},{"node":{"id":97415,"name":{"full":"Noboru Kimura"}},"role":"Series Composition"},{"node":{"id":197856,"name":{"full":"Sayaka Ono"}},"role":"Character Design"},{"node":{"id":97180,"name":{"full":"Ryou Akizuki"}},"role":"Prop Design"},{"node":{"id":150761,"name":{"full":"Masaki Hiraoka"}},"role":"Prop Design"},{"node":{"id":120038,"name":{"full":"Yuki Maeda"}},"role":"Art Director"},{"node":{"id":128665,"name":{"full":"Naomi Nakano"}},"role":"Color Design"},{"node":{"id":262797,"name":{"full":"Ayako Ootsuki"}},"role":"Director of Photography"},{"node":{"id":137133,"name":{"full":"Masato Yoshitake"}},"role":"Editing"},{"node":{"id":163907,"name":{"full":"Takuji Gojima"}},"role":"CG Director"},{"node":{"id":119938,"name":{"full":"Hiroto Morishita"}},"role":"Sound Director"},{"node":{"id":99980,"name":{"full":"Yuuki Hayashi"}},"role":"Music"},{"node":{"id":197856,"name":{"full":"Sayaka Ono"}},"role":"Chief Animation Director (OP, ED, eps 1-4)"},{"node":{"id":294967,"name":{"full":"ASH DA HERO"}},"role":"Theme Song Performance (OP)"},{"node":{"id":297532,"name":{"full":"Shiyui"}},"role":"Theme Song Performance (ED)"},{"node":{"id":157993,"name":{"full":"Akira Kikuchi"}},"role":"Monster Design"},{"node":{"id":210029,"name":{"full":"Raita Sunaga"}},"role":"Monster Design"},{"node":{"id":236508,"name":{"full":"Yoshirou Harada"}},"role":"Monster Design"},{"node":{"id":112047,"name":{"full":"Tatsuya Yoshihara"}},"role":"Storyboard (OP, ED)"},{"node":{"id":155068,"name":{"full":"Hiroaki Kudou"}},"role":"Episode Director (ep 1)"},{"node":{"id":97415,"name":{"full":"Noboru Kimura"}},"role":"Script (eps 1, 2)"},{"node":{"id":119347,"name":{"full":"Hideaki Nakano"}},"role":"Storyboard (ep 1)"}]},"startDate":{"day":12,"month":4,"year":2026},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":60,"name":"Actas"},{"id":6116,"name":"Bandai Namco Pictures"}]},"trailer":{"id":"57OL0uTIBVg","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/57OL0uTIBVg/hqdefault.jpg"}}},"updated_at":"2026-06-16T01:50:39.388571411+05:30"},"189046":{"value":{"Media":{"averageScore":88,"characters":{"edges":[{"id":525525,"node":{"age":"14-19","dateOfBirth":{"day":23,"month":9},"description":"**Height:** 164 cm (5'5\")\n\nShe is a silver-haired half-elf girl who is one of the candidates to become the next ruler in the royal election. [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) first meets her when her insignia is stolen by [Felt](https://anilist.co/character/88574/Felt) as she needs to possess it to be eligible to participate in the election. She introduces herself as Satella when she and Subaru met during the first timeline before introducing herself by her real name when she got her insignia back.\n\nEmilia is good natured and likes to take care of others, though she herself refuses to admit it, instead thinking of it as her own selfishness. She is indifferent to her own appearance, leaving [Puck](https://anilist.co/character/90187/Puck) to take care of her clothes and hair. Because her appearance is similar to the [Witch of Envy](https://anilist.co/character/127242/Satella), she has received unfair discrimination from others. She sometimes acts like a child and is unacquainted with the world as she used to live in the woods with other Elves, though despite this she still works hard to become a ruler.","gender":"Female","id":88572,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88572-IzTwXEHSobRs.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Satella","Lia","Emilia-tan","Witch of Glaciation","Hyouketsu no Majo (氷結の魔女)","Witch of Frost","Han Ma (半魔)","Half-Devil","Mili","Emily"],"full":"Emilia","native":"エミリア"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/88572"},"role":"MAIN"},{"id":525526,"node":{"age":"17-","dateOfBirth":{"day":1,"month":4},"description":"__Height:__ 173 cm (5'8\")\n\nOn the way home from the convenience store, he suddenly finds himself transported into another world. He has the ability that he calls \"Return by Death\" to go back in time when he dies. Despite being a hikikomori and gamer in his real world, Subaru does a bit of workout and seems to know basic hand-to-hand combat, making him not completely weak.\n\nWhile Subaru tends to not read the situation, he is loyal to those he holds dear, willing to help them, even if that means taking the thorny path. He has his resolve confirmed through the many situations and circumstances he faces in the fantasy world, originally having been one to always take the \"easy\" route. As a hikikomori, he is hopeful of the possibilities that being sucked into a new realm brings, but later realizes the realities of the predicament he is in. Ultimately, he resolves himself to be faithful and protective of the ones that he cares most about.","gender":"Male","id":88573,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88573-F8yMTK9GhnTA.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Barusu","Lolimancer","Young Su","Baru","Subaruun","Natsumi Schwartz","Bals","Le Chevalier de la Demi-Elfe","The Half Elf's Knight","Natsuki Schwartz","Spirit Knight","Purge King","Captain","Boss","Suu","Basu"],"full":"Subaru Natsuki","native":"ナツキ・スバル"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/88573"},"role":"MAIN"},{"id":525532,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"__Height:__ 140 cm (4'7\")\n__Age:__ ~!400+ (Actual)!~\n\nThe caretaker of the library in [Roswaal](https://anilist.co/character/90182)'s mansion. \n\nShe has a distinct way of speaking, adding \"I suppose\" (かしら, kashira) and \"in fact\" (のよ, no yo) at the end of some of her sentences.\n\n~!Around 400 years ago, Beatrice was created by [Echidna](https://anilist.co/character/129330). She helped her with her experiments, such as the Sanctuary Barrier, though she wasn't told everything as she didn't know that [Ryuuzu Meyer](https://anilist.co/character/174072) would be sealed in a crystal. Sometime later, Echidna ordered her to stand guard over the library while she waited for \"that person,\" an order which she diligently followed.!~\n\n~!After numerous and painful attempts to convince her to leave the library [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573) succeeded, and Beatrice became his contract spirit.!~","gender":"Female","id":90181,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b90181-wRPm0OEaucmw.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Beako","Betty","Campaign Slayer"],"full":"Beatrice","native":"ベアトリス"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/90181"},"role":"MAIN"},{"id":525533,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":4,"month":10},"description":"One of the children that lives in the village within [Roswaal](https://anilist.co/character/90182)'s region. She's timid, though is friendly, such as when she introduces a small dog to [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573). \n~!Meili Portroute is a Demon Beast User.!~","id":175577,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175577-lUNPAV3Gujl3.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Meili Portroute","native":"メィリィ・ポートルート"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/175577"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":570668,"node":{"age":"20","dateOfBirth":{"day":24,"month":3},"description":"\nOtto Suwen is a merchant appearing in  Re:Zero. His remarkable misfortune always takes him to dangerous situations, from which he escapes thanks to his wit.\nOtto has gray hair that is mentioned to be as long as a gal game protagonist. He is said to be somewhat handsome if he has a serious expression. However, he is usually either retorting, shouting, or panicking, ruining his looks. He has a medium build, but has trained himself since he used to work as a merchant.\n","gender":"Male","id":124110,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b124110-Gfr3IYI6FwqE.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Otto Suwen","native":"オットー・スーウェン"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/124110"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":570676,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Garek Thompson and Reala Thompson's daughter. She is half-siblings with Garfiel and Frederica.","gender":"Female","id":346673,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b346673-3mgEvkg2SM4m.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Rafiel Thompson","native":"ラフィール・トンプソン"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/346673"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":532164,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":20,"month":12},"description":"Shaula is the overseer of the Pleiades Watchtower created by Flugel. She is tall, has dark green eyes and long brown blackish hair. Her outfit has a similar color scheme to that of Subaru. It is noted that the design for her outfit came from Flugel and her mother. Shaula is seen as empty-headed and unconcerned, yet Shaula has been shown to show deep emotion in certain situations especially with Subaru.\n","gender":"Female","id":184458,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b184458-wchLacBSRg3L.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Stars-Keeper of the Watchtower"],"full":"Shaula","native":"シャウラ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/184458"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":570669,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":6,"month":12},"description":"Frederica Baumann is a maid working for Roswaal L. Mathers and a member of the Emilia Camp. She quit her job as a maid a few months before Subaru's appearance, but returned after Ram couldn't manage the mansion ~! after Rem had her name and memories eaten. !~\n\n~! She is the half-sister of [Garfiel Tinsel](https://anilist.co/character/133847/). !~","gender":"Female","id":143378,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b143378-1pXqjZho4dhz.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Frederica Tinsel "],"full":"Frederica Baumann","native":"フレデリカ・バウマン"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/143378"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":570677,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Mother of [Garfiel](https://anilist.co/character/133847) and [Frederica](https://anilist.co/character/143378).","gender":"Female","id":205112,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b205112-xRtGam1Yu0Cp.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Reala Thompson (リアラ・トンプソン)"],"full":"Reshia Tinzel","native":"リーシア・ティンゼル"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/205112"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":525527,"node":{"age":"17-","dateOfBirth":{"day":2,"month":2},"description":"__Height:__ 154 cm (5'1\")\n\nRem is one of the twin maids working for [Roswaal L Mathers](https://anilist.co/character/90182/Mathers-L-Roswaal). She has medium length sky blue hair that covers her right eye, large light blue eyes, and young features. She also has hair clips towards left side of her hair, flower-shaped ribbon on the same side of her hair, and a maid hairband. She looks nearly identical to her sister [Ram](https://anilist.co/character/88576) apart from her hair, eyes, and ribbon coloring. She usually wears a maid uniform, and since her chest is slightly larger than her sister's, she secretly changes the measurements to hide it. Rem tends to speak in a superficially polite manner and sometimes acts without thinking. She holds both respect to the point of worship and guilt toward her sister for an incident in the past. Because of her respect and guilt toward her sister, she used to think of herself as inferior. ","gender":"Female","id":88575,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88575-Ayu8UPDA8NS6.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Rem-rin"],"full":"Rem","native":"レム"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/88575"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":548480,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Louis Arneb is a Sin Archbishop of the Witch Cult, representing the satiation aspect of gluttony. Louis has large blue eyes and extremely long blond hair as well she has sharp fang like teeth. Her skin appears white as pottery and she wears rags to cover herself. Unlike Roy and Lye, Louis doesn't care much about what she eats, putting more emphasis on who she eats with. Louis believes life is unfair and her ideology is trying to find a life that will satisfy her. Louis does not think fondly of her brothers despite them bringing her food and to some degree caring for her. ~!Like Roy and Lye, Louis has to similar skills shared between the gluttony’s. Louis has access to “Authority of Gluttony”, unlike other types of authority there are different forms and effects that come from being affected by the authority. Louis can eat a name and memories of an individual. To achieve eating a name he touches the individual with his left hand, then licks the palm of the same hand. Louis can then take things such as experience, talent, likes and dislikes of human relationships and they can serve as food for him, allowing him to take advantage of any abilities or memories his opponents had. Those that have their names eaten have their existences erased from the world. This will end any human relationships and remove any contracts with spirits\nThose who have their memories eaten become amnesic and any types of characteristics they had previous are removed. Those who have their name and memories eaten become an empty shell, while they are still alive they no longer require the need to eat,excrete waste or age. While this ability is powerful on paper it has to major drawbacks If Louis eats a fake name or memory he will become plagued with severe nausea. Louis is also unable to eat the same person twice until that individual has gained enough new memories or has established a different sense of self from their old existence.!~\n~!Louis has access to what she calls his trump card known as “Eclipse” it has two forms “Solar Eclipse” and “Lunar Eclipse”.\n\n__Lunar Eclipse__ - This skill allows Louis  to take an individual's memories and use them to harvest skills or knowledge they have learned for his own benefit. An example of its use is when Lye used “Lunar Eclipse” to boost his physical strength and learn techniques such as “The Palm of the Fist King” and the Leaper technique or when  Roy used “Lunar Eclipse” to boost his physical strength and speed against Julius Juukulius and Ricardo Welkin.  This skill CANNOT allow Louis to take divine protections or spirit arts and authorities.\n\n__Solar Eclipse__ - The inverse of “Lunar Eclipse”. This skill allows Louis  to take an individual's name and transform to their appearance.  Unlike Lye and Roy with their dislike of having Solar Eclipse, Louis tends to primarily use Solar Eclipse as she doesn't share the same fear as her two brothers of feeling like they are damaged when using the skill. !~~!Louis as well has a large arsenal of skills and abilities besides the three mentioned above.\n\n__Leaper technique__ -This technique allows Louis to move with extreme speed and in turn become undetectable by the naked eye, allowing her to leap behind his opponents or avoid extremely precise and quick attacks. She's also capable of utilizing it vertically, making it appear as if she's flying. Lye took his move from  Dorkell\n\n__Ability of the Carnivorous Beast__ - This ability allows Louis to strengthen her body which gives her two advantages: she can withstand powerful attacks and strengthen her limbs to deliver devastating blows. An example is when she was able take a hit from Emilia's ice spear and came out unscathed and deliver a retaliating punch that is said to be as devastating as getting hit by a car. This ability was taken from Beli Heinelga.!~\n\n~!Because Lye, Roy and Louis possess the Witch Factors of Gluttony they are able to direct demon beasts to attack certain areas. !~","gender":"Female","id":175582,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175582-hDwS4CVocZa5.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Rui Arneb"],"full":"Louis Arneb","native":"ルイ・アルネブ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/175582"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":570670,"node":{"age":"29-","dateOfBirth":{"day":16,"month":9},"description":"~!__Mental age:__ 400+!~\nThe lord of the Roswaal Mansion and a descendant of the original Roswaal.\n\nHe comes across as an eccentric due to his flamboyant appearance and odd speaking style, the latter which he shares with his grandmother. However, he harbors a more calculating and reserved side with a sharp political mind and gaze that reads others quite well.\n\n~!It is later revealed that he is in fact the original Roswaal, Roswaal A. Mathers, who has been possessing his descendants' bodies to meet his teacher Echidna again at any cost, even if that means sacrificing himself or those close to him.!~","gender":"Male","id":90182,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b90182-Ho0NS06tc6NL.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Ros-chi"],"full":"Roswaal Mathers","native":"ロズワール・Ｌ・メイザース"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/90182"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":570678,"node":{"age":"19","dateOfBirth":{"day":16,"month":1},"description":"Felix Argyle commonly known as Ferris, is [Crusch Karsten](https://anilist.co/character/90185)'s knight. He is a beast human (demi-human).","gender":"Male","id":90184,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b90184-o1ZFF6osCZX7.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Argail","Ferris (フェリス)","Ferri-chan"],"full":"Felix Argyle","native":"フェリックス・アーガイル"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/90184"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":525528,"node":{"age":"17-","dateOfBirth":{"day":2,"month":2},"description":"__Height:__ 154 cm (5’1”)\n\nRam is one of the twin maids working for [Roswaal L Mathers](https://anilist.co/character/90182). She has medium length light pink hair that covers her left eye, large darkish pink eyes, and young features. She also has hair clips towards right side of her hair, flower-shaped ribbon on the same side of her hair, and a maid hairband. She looks nearly identical to her sister [Rem](https://anilist.co/character/88575/Rem) apart from her hair, eyes, and ribbon coloring. Ram is seemingly self-centered and does things at her own pace, however in actuality she maintains a distance from people to ascertain them. She believes that Roswaal is the greatest and no one else is as precious except for her sister Rem. She is slightly more outgoing in comparison to the generally taciturn Rem, who generally allows Ram to take the lead in their sisterly bond.","gender":"Female","id":88576,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88576-NWkotUiJ3mK3.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Ram-chi","Ramu"],"full":"Ram","native":"ラム"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/88576"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":548481,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Roy Alphard is a Sin Archbishop of the Witch Cult, representing the bizarre eating aspect of gluttony. \nHe has long disheveled brown hair, with green eyes that are yellow are the center and teeth shaped like sharp fangs. He wears a small piece of cloth around his body as clothing.\n\n\nUnlike his brother Lye, Roy doesn’t care about what he consumes nor does he place any special emphasis on who he wants to eat like his sister Louis. As “bizarre eating” of gluttony, his approach towards his meals is much more casual, emphasizing quantity over quality. In combat unlike Lye he does not give his opponents a chance and likes to exploit their weaknesses to completely destroy them. \n\n\n~! \nLike Lye and Louis, Roy has two similar skills shared between the gluttony’s \n\nRoy has access to “Authority of Gluttony”, unlike other types of authority there are different forms and effects that come from being affected by the authority.\n\nRoy can eat a name and memories of an individual. To achieve eating a name he touches the individual with his left hand, then licks the palm of the same hand. Roy can then take things such as experience, talent, likes and dislikes of human relationships and they can serve as food for him, allowing him to take advantage of any abilities or memories his opponents had. \n\nThose that have their names eaten have their existences erased from the world. This will end any human relationships and remove any contracts with spirits\nThose who have their memories eaten become amnesic and any types of characteristics they had previous are removed.\nThose who have their name and memories eaten become an empty shell, while they are still alive they no longer require the need to eat,excrete waste or age. \n\nWhile this ability is powerful on paper it has two major drawbacks\n\nIf Roy eats a fake name or memory he will become plagued with severe nausea.\nRoy is also unable to eat the same person twice until that individual has gained enough new memories or has established a different sense of self from their old existence.  \n\n!~\n","id":175578,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b175578-LVgtk9D4XfZs.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Roy Alphard","native":"ロイ・アルファルド"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/175578"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":570671,"node":{"age":"12-","dateOfBirth":{"day":14,"month":2},"description":"Petra is a bright and kind girl from Irlam Village. She likes [Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) very much after he saved her from the Wolgarm incident.\n\n~!She became a maid at the Roswaal Mansion after Subaru came back from the witchcult incident. !~","gender":"Female","id":141858,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b141858-wO0Uj6o4OpUI.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Petra Leyte","native":"ペトラ・レイテ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/141858"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":573139,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Regulus is a young man of a medium height. He has gold eyes, white hair and a middle to skinny build. Regulus Is a part of the Sin Archbishops of the Witch Cult and represents greed.  Regulus is known for being very talkative and calls himself unselfish, while in fact he is very prideful and likes to act above others and reference himself as above others.\n\n","gender":"Male","id":174098,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174098-8xjd9vK1KmkP.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Sin Archbishop of Greed"],"full":"Regulus Corneas","native":"レグルス・コルニアス"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/174098"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":525529,"node":{"age":"21","dateOfBirth":{"day":7,"month":7},"description":"__Height__: 179 cm (5'10\")\n\nJulius Euclius is Anastasia Hoshin's knight and a member of the Royal Guard. Julius lived with his family at the Euclius House. After his father, Klein Euclius died, he started to live with his uncle Alviero and he started to take care of Julius and became his adoptive father.\n\nAs a member of Lugnica's nobility, Julius acts in a proper fashion, always having an air of nobility and conviction. He is also considerate and doesn't forget to show care toward others. He also shows a strict side, giving out accurate assessments of others whether they're good or bad, which is a result of his upbringing as an elite, and in actuality, he believes that he and others can do better than they currently are.\n\nJulius doesn't like those who forget their place, leading him to have bad relations with Subaru for a while. While both have apologized to each other after the battle with the Hakugei, Subaru told him he still hated him. Julius said he didn't intend to be friends. They both became very intimate very quickly during the planning and attacking the Witch Cult. In the end, Julius directly considered Subaru as his friend.\n","gender":"Male","id":90183,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b90183-LWx59kSa5Vjl.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Julius Juukulius","最優の騎士 (Saiyuu no Kishi)","Valuable Knight","ユーリ (Juli)"],"full":"Julius Euclius","native":"ユリウス・ユークリウス"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/90183"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":548482,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Reid Astrea was the first Sword Saint and a key figure in the sealing of the Witch of Envy 400 years ago. ","id":201311,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b201311-TaOilb53XK39.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Reid Astrea","native":"レイド・アストレア"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/201311"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":570672,"node":{"age":"19-","dateOfBirth":{"day":1,"month":1},"description":"__Height__: 184 cm (6'0\")\n\nReinhard van Astrea is the current Sword Saint and a member of the Royal Guard, currently acting as [Felt](https://anilist.co/character/88574/Felt)'s knight. \n\nAs the Sword Saint and the Knight of the Royal Guard, Reinhard embodies chivalry and elegance, treating everyone with exceptional respect. He is fair, brave, and always acts in the name of justice, whether on duty or simply strolling through the Royal Capital.\n\nAs a knight, Reinhard only uses his sword when necessary, since, in addition to being a rule, his iron-clad rule is to not inflict pain to others if not absolutely necessary, be it a normal thug or a member of the Witch Cult.","gender":"Male","id":88577,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88577-oKKnibqGgSSD.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Kensei (剣聖)","Sword Saint","Knight Implacable"],"full":"Reinhard van Astrea","native":"ラインハルト・ヴァン・アストレア"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/88577"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":525530,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{"day":15,"month":4},"description":"[Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru)'s Earth Dragon that he officially received from [Crusch Karsten](https://anilist.co/character/90185/Karsten-Crusch) for his efforts in the Hakugei battle. Despite being of a species known for being feisty, Patrasche is extremely loyal to Subaru, as she is willing to put her life on the line for him.","id":181313,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b181313-eT4mFPCZj1OZ.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Patrasche","native":"パトラッシュ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/181313"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":557441,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Lye Batenkaitos is a Sin Archbishop of the Witch Cult, representing the gourmet aspect of gluttony. Lye is a short individual with long light brown hair, green eyes and teeth shaped like sharp fangs. He wears blue and purple clothes and a witch cult rope, but they are both very dirty and bloodstained. He also has attached daggers to his hands he received from the cult. \n\n\n","id":174097,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b174097-4QaG0jvIft6S.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"full":"Lye Batenkaitos","native":"ライ・バテンカイトス"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/174097"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":570673,"node":{"age":"14-","dateOfBirth":{"day":8,"month":8},"description":"**Height:** 150 cm (4'11\")\n\nA thief that lives in the slums. Felt stole [Emilia](https://anilist.co/character/88572/Emilia)'s insignia, hoping for quick, easy cash. Though Felt can usually handle her own, she does consider [Rom](https://anilist.co/character/124117/Rom) to be like family.\n\n~!After being chosen by the insignia, she is forced to participate in the Royal Selection and is currently a candidate to become the 42nd King of Lugunica.!~","gender":"Female","id":88574,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b88574-Hau8t0GlMvhp.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Feruto"],"full":"Felt","native":"フェルト"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/88574"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":573141,"node":{"dateOfBirth":{},"description":"Sin Archbishop of the Witch Cult, representing sloth.\n\n~!He was later killed by [Natsuki Subaru](https://anilist.co/character/88573/Natsuki-Subaru) with the help of [Julius Juukulius](https://anilist.co/character/90183/Euclius-Julius).!~\n\n~!A hundred years earlier, Petelgeuse was a moderate, upright and rational man. He was close friends with [Fortuna](https://anilist.co/character/183732/Fortuna) and [Emilia](https://anilist.co/character/88572/Emilia), enough to be described as being like a family. However, when [Regulus](https://anilist.co/character/174098/Corneas-Regulus) and [Pandora](https://anilist.co/character/137522/Pandora) attacked their village, he accidentally killed Fortuna through Pandora's power, causing him to go mad.!~","gender":"Male","id":90170,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b90170-sHsO9ojQDLa3.jpg"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Betelgeuse","Geuse (ジュース)"],"full":"Petelgeuse Romanee-Conti","native":"ペテルギウス・ロマネコンティ"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/90170"},"role":"SUPPORTING"},{"id":525531,"node":{"age":"22-","dateOfBirth":{"day":10,"month":3},"description":"Anastasia Hoshin is the head of the Hoshin Trading Company and a candidate to become the 42nd King of Lugnica. Her knight is Julius Juukulius.\n\nDespite her surname being \"Hoshin\", she's not directly related to Hoshin of the Wilderness. She chose the name because she was inspired by his legacy.","gender":"Female","id":90177,"image":{"large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b90177-K1XztcZqHl3c.png"},"isFavourite":false,"name":{"alternative":["Black Fox","Greedy Princess","Iron Plate Magistrate"],"full":"Anastasia Hoshin","native":"アナスタシア・ホーシン"},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/character/90177"},"role":"SUPPORTING"}]},"description":"The fourth season of \u003ci\u003eRe:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu\u003c/i\u003e.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nTo save his stricken allies, Subaru faces a deadly desert to find the Sage at Pleiades Watchtower.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll News)\n\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Episode 1 pre-screened at Lucca Comics \u0026 Games on November 1, 2025, before the Japanese television broadcast.","duration":24,"endDate":{},"genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Psychological","Romance"],"id":189046,"meanScore":88,"popularity":107897,"rankings":[{"allTime":true,"context":"highest rated all time","format":"TV","rank":17,"type":"RATED"},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":1,"type":"RATED","year":2026},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":5,"type":"POPULAR","year":2026},{"allTime":false,"context":"highest rated","format":"TV","rank":1,"season":"SPRING","type":"RATED","year":2026},{"allTime":false,"context":"most popular","format":"TV","rank":1,"season":"SPRING","type":"POPULAR","year":2026}],"recommendations":{"edges":[{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n9253-JIhmKgBKsWUN.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#ffd6ae","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx9253-tIUXF2gfU8Sg.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx9253-tIUXF2gfU8Sg.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx9253-tIUXF2gfU8Sg.jpg"},"description":"Self-proclaimed mad scientist Okabe Rintarou lives in a small room in Akihabara, where he invents \"future gadgets\" with fellow lab members Shiina Mayuri, his air-headed childhood friend, and Hashida Itaru, an otaku hacker. The three pass the time by tinkering with their latest creation, a \"Phone Microwave\" that can be controlled through text messages. \n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nThe lab members soon face a string of mysterious incidents that lead to a game-changing discovery: the Phone Microwave can send emails to the past and thus alter history. Adapted from the critically acclaimed visual novel by 5pb. and Nitroplus, Steins;Gate takes Okabe to the depths of scientific theory and human despair as he faces the dire consequences of changing the past.","episodes":24,"format":"TV","id":9253,"idMal":9253,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":89,"season":"SPRING","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/9253","startDate":{"day":6,"month":4,"year":2011},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Steins;Gate","native":"シュタインズ・ゲート","romaji":"Steins;Gate","userPreferred":"Steins;Gate"},"trailer":{"id":"27OZc-ku6is","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/27OZc-ku6is/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/129201-eeCsKFrCSQPS.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#2886e4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx129201-HJBauga2be8I.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx129201-HJBauga2be8I.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx129201-HJBauga2be8I.png"},"description":"A sci-fi, summer story filled with suspense set on a small island with Shinpei Aijiro, whose childhood friend Ushio Kofune died. He returns to his hometown for the first time in two years for the funeral. Sou Hishigata, his best friend, suspects something's off with Ushio's death, and that someone can die next. \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nA sinister omen is heard as an entire family next door suddenly disappears the following day. Furthermore, Mio implicates a \"shadow\" three days before Ushio's death. \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Disney+)","episodes":25,"format":"TV","id":129201,"idMal":47194,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":83,"season":"SPRING","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/129201","startDate":{"day":15,"month":4,"year":2022},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Summer Time Rendering","native":"サマータイムレンダ","romaji":"Summer Time Render","userPreferred":"Summer Time Rendering"},"trailer":{"id":"_JgOMtS2FkE","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_JgOMtS2FkE/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/146065-33RDijfuxLLk.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#35aee4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx146065-IjirxRK26O03.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx146065-IjirxRK26O03.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx146065-IjirxRK26O03.png"},"description":"After his relationship with Eris Boreas Greyrat reaches new heights, Rudeus Greyrat is ecstatic. Unfortunately, his joy is short-lived, as Eris suddenly abandons him to embark on her own journey. Believing that Eris has lost all interest in him, a heartbroken and depressed Rudeus sets forth to the Northern Territories. With his sole goal being to locate his mother on the vast continent, Rudeus wonders if persisting through daily life is worth the pain, falling into a robotic routine as he endlessly ruminates on his lost love.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\nHowever, the dangers of the North soon prove that one cannot survive with a dulled mind. While on a quest with the party Counter Arrow, with whom he recently became acquainted, Rudeus has a brush with death—an experience that forces him to finally snap out of his despair. With his newfound teammates, Rudeus rediscovers the pleasure of daily adventuring and moves forward with his original goal of living his second lease on life to the fullest.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003ci\u003eNote: Includes episode 0, Shugo Jutsushi Fitz.\u003c/i\u003e","episodes":13,"format":"TV","id":146065,"idMal":51179,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":81,"season":"SUMMER","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/146065","startDate":{"day":3,"month":7,"year":2023},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 2","native":"無職転生Ⅱ ～異世界行ったら本気だす～","romaji":"Mushoku Tensei II: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu","userPreferred":"Mushoku Tensei: Jobless Reincarnation Season 2"},"trailer":{"id":"ts5NGoDI1V0","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ts5NGoDI1V0/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21127-6jTjz7ndTHOi.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#f1d6bb","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21127-7ARWZkDXKiiD.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21127-7ARWZkDXKiiD.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21127-7ARWZkDXKiiD.jpg"},"description":"The eccentric, self-proclaimed mad scientist Rintarou Okabe has become a shell of his former self. Depressed and traumatized after failing to rescue his friend, he has decided to forsake his mad scientist alter ego and live as an ordinary college student. Surrounded by friends who know little of his time travel experiences, Okabe spends his days trying to forget the horrors of his adventures alone.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nWhile working as a receptionist at a college technology forum, Okabe meets the short, spunky Maho Hiyajo, who\nlater turns out to be the interpreter at the forum's presentation, conducted by Professor Alexis Leskinen. In front of a stunned crowd, Alexis and Maho unveil Amadeus—a revolutionary AI capable of storing a person's memories and creating a perfect simulation of that person complete with their personality and quirks. Meeting with Maho and Alexis after the presentation, Okabe learns that the two were Kurisu's colleagues in university, and that they have simulated her in Amadeus. Hired by Alexis to research the simulation's behavior, Okabe is given the chance to interact with the shadow of a long-lost dear friend. Dangerously tangled in the past, Okabe must face the harsh reality and carefully maneuver around the disastrous consequences that come with disturbing the natural flow of time.\n","episodes":23,"format":"TV","id":21127,"idMal":30484,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":84,"season":"SPRING","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21127","startDate":{"day":12,"month":4,"year":2018},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Steins;Gate 0","native":"シュタインズ・ゲート ゼロ","romaji":"Steins;Gate 0","userPreferred":"Steins;Gate 0"},"trailer":{"id":"IVVihb4-cHo","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IVVihb4-cHo/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21234-7lfSSPoMmwr2.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#f1a150","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx21234-XmqW39aQ9o7O.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx21234-XmqW39aQ9o7O.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx21234-XmqW39aQ9o7O.jpg"},"description":"Satoru Fujinuma is a 29 year old manga artist struggling to make a name for himself following his debut. But, that was not the only thing in his life that Satoru was feeling frustrated about… He has a unique supernatural ability of being forced to prevent deaths and catastrophes by being sent back in time before the incident occurred, repeating time until the accident is prevented. One day, he gets involved in an accident that has him framed as a murderer. Desperate to save the victim, he sends himself back in time only to find himself as a grade-schooler one month before fellow classmate Kayo Hinazuki went missing. Satoru now embarks on a new quest: to save Kayo and solve the mystery behind her disappearance.\n","episodes":12,"format":"TV","id":21234,"idMal":31043,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":81,"season":"WINTER","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21234","startDate":{"day":8,"month":1,"year":2016},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"ERASED","native":"僕だけがいない街","romaji":"Boku dake ga Inai Machi","userPreferred":"ERASED"},"trailer":{"id":"TZzMOC-4k6M","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TZzMOC-4k6M/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101280-9t7J3774n955.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#5daef1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101280-tDxCVJm714nt.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx101280-tDxCVJm714nt.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx101280-tDxCVJm714nt.jpg"},"description":"Lonely thirty-seven-year-old Satoru Mikami is stuck in a dead-end job, unhappy with his mundane life, but after dying at the hands of a robber, he awakens to a fresh start in a fantasy realm...as a slime monster! As he acclimates to his goopy new existence, his exploits with the other monsters set off a chain of events that will change his new world forever!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n(Source: Yen Press)","episodes":24,"format":"TV","id":101280,"idMal":37430,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":80,"season":"FALL","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/101280","startDate":{"day":2,"month":10,"year":2018},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime","native":"転生したらスライムだった件","romaji":"Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken","userPreferred":"That Time I Got Reincarnated as a Slime"},"trailer":{"id":"uOzwqb74K34","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uOzwqb74K34/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/11577.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#5daee4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx11577-rhqsxLOAge4f.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx11577-rhqsxLOAge4f.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx11577-rhqsxLOAge4f.png"},"description":"After a year in America, Kurisu Makise returns to Akihabara and reunites with Rintarou Okabe. However, their reunion is cut short when Okabe begins to experience recurring flashes of other timelines as the consequences of his time traveling start to manifest. These side effects eventually culminate in Okabe suddenly vanishing from the world, and only the startled Kurisu has any memory of his existence.\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\nIn the midst of despair, Kurisu is faced with a truly arduous choice that will test both her duty as a scientist and her loyalty as a friend: follow Okabe's advice and stay away from traveling through time to avoid the potential consequences it may have on the world lines, or ignore it to rescue the person that she cherishes most. Regardless of her decision, the path she chooses is one that will affect the past, the present, and the future.\n","episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","id":11577,"idMal":11577,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":82,"season":"SPRING","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/11577","startDate":{"day":20,"month":4,"year":2013},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"Steins;Gate The Movie – Load Region of Déjà Vu","native":"劇場版 シュタインズゲート 負荷領域のデジャヴ","romaji":"Steins;Gate: Fuka Ryouiki no Déjà vu","userPreferred":"Steins;Gate The Movie – Load Region of Déjà Vu"},"trailer":{"id":"rDsCNz3pWUg","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/rDsCNz3pWUg/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}},{"node":{"mediaRecommendation":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/185116-eQ55D57Wj1oJ.jpg","coverImage":{"color":"#43aee4","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx185116-DIFRjiMgz1IS.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx185116-DIFRjiMgz1IS.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx185116-DIFRjiMgz1IS.jpg"},"description":"The story of \u003ci\u003eGNOSIA\u003c/i\u003e takes place on a ship drifting through space. Gnosia is an enemy that disguises itself as a human and attacks them. It is now on the spaceship, causing everyone onboard to be suspicious of each other. The crew decides to vote on the most suspicious-looking person every day and put them into a cold sleep.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nIf the humans succeed in putting Gnosia to sleep, they'll win. On the other hand, if they don't, everyone on board is in danger. The right decision must be made. No matter what decision is made by the main character, Yuri, she finds herself in a time loop that returns her to the first day of the crisis. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nWill the crew on board make the right decision? What is the secret behind the time loop? What secrets hide behind the faces of everyone on board?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n\u003ci\u003eGNOSIA\u003c/i\u003e begins now – a story of looping, fleeting moments that feels like an eternity but passes by in an instant.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nHave a pleasant journey.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","episodes":21,"format":"TV","id":185116,"idMal":60427,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":78,"season":"FALL","siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/185116","startDate":{"day":12,"month":10,"year":2025},"status":"FINISHED","title":{"english":"GNOSIA","native":"グノーシア","romaji":"Gnosia","userPreferred":"GNOSIA"},"trailer":{"id":"Rm4ipMdFpeA","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Rm4ipMdFpeA/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"}}}]},"relations":{"edges":[{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/163134-CqaXjXVivwJ5.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#bbd6f1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx163134-yieRFbvUOH9a.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx163134-yieRFbvUOH9a.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx163134-yieRFbvUOH9a.jpg"},"description":"The third season of \u003ci\u003eRe:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu\u003c/i\u003e. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\nA year has passed since Subaru’s victory at the Sanctuary. He savors a life of fulfillment while Emilia’s camp stands united for the royal selection—until a fateful letter arrives. Anastasia, a royal selection candidate, has invited Emilia to the Watergate City of Priestella. But as the party begins its journey, crisis stirs beneath the surface and Subaru meets a cruel fate once again.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Crunchyroll) \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\n\u003ci\u003eNote: The first episode has an extended runtime of ~90 minutes, and received an early premiere at Anime Expo on July 5, 2024.\u003c/i\u003e","duration":24,"endDate":{"day":26,"month":3,"year":2025},"episodes":16,"format":"TV","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Psychological","Romance","Thriller"],"id":163134,"idMal":54857,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":84,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2024,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/163134","startDate":{"day":2,"month":10,"year":2024},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["Re:ZERO – Жизнь с нуля в альтернативном мире 3"],"title":{"english":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- Season 3","native":"Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活 3rd season","romaji":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu 3rd Season","userPreferred":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World- Season 3"},"trailer":{"id":"qMJNdQFPaHk","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qMJNdQFPaHk/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"PREQUEL"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/85737-jCG8ine3fTDr.png","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx85737-WkWOr5EgwPyo.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/bx85737-WkWOr5EgwPyo.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/small/bx85737-WkWOr5EgwPyo.jpg"},"description":"Subaru Natsuki was just trying to get to the convenience store but wound up summoned to another world. He encounters the usual things--life-threatening situations, silver haired beauties, cat fairies--you know, normal stuff. All that would be bad enough, but he's also gained the most inconvenient magical ability of all--time travel, but he's got to die to use it. How do you repay someone who saved your life when all you can do is die?\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Yen Press)","endDate":{},"format":"NOVEL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery","Psychological","Romance","Thriller"],"id":85737,"idMal":74697,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":88,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/manga/85737","startDate":{"day":24,"month":1,"year":2014},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["ReZero","Re: Life in a different world from zero","Re:Zero - Życie w innym świecie od zera","Re:Zero - Жизнь с нуля в альтернативном мире","Re: Zero - Bắt đầu lại ở thế giới khác","Re:Zero รีเซทชีวิต ฝ่าวิกฤตต่างโลก","Re:Zero – Começando Uma Vida em Outro Mundo","Re:Zero - Re:vivre dans un autre monde à partir de zéro"],"title":{"english":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-","native":"Re:ゼロから始める異世界生活","romaji":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu","userPreferred":"Re:ZERO -Starting Life in Another World-"},"trailer":{"id":"jTmeuNBYB7g","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/jTmeuNBYB7g/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"MANGA"},"relationType":"SOURCE"},{"node":{"countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#a1e4c9","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx210687-H54G1bTwCBpV.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx210687-H54G1bTwCBpV.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx210687-H54G1bTwCBpV.jpg"},"description":"The fourth season of Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Kyuukei Jikan (Break Time).","duration":3,"endDate":{},"format":"ONA","genres":["Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":210687,"idMal":63830,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":73,"nextAiringEpisode":{"airingAt":1781703000,"episode":11,"timeUntilAiring":147976},"season":"SPRING","seasonYear":2026,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/210687","startDate":{"day":8,"month":4,"year":2026},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["Re:ZERO ~Starting Break Time From Zero~ Season 4"],"title":{"native":"Re:ゼロから始める休憩時間(ブレイクタイム) 4th Season","romaji":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Kyuukei Jikan (Break Time) 4th Season","userPreferred":"Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Kyuukei Jikan (Break Time) 4th Season"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SPIN_OFF"}]},"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/189046","staff":{"edges":[{"node":{"id":118885,"name":{"full":"Tappei Nagatsuki"}},"role":"Original Story"},{"node":{"id":118886,"name":{"full":"Shinichirou Ootsuka"}},"role":"Original Character Design"},{"node":{"id":134798,"name":{"full":"Masahiro Shinohara"}},"role":"Director "},{"node":{"id":114175,"name":{"full":"Masahiro Yokotani"}},"role":"Series Composition"},{"node":{"id":124675,"name":{"full":"Haruka Sagawa"}},"role":"Character Design"},{"node":{"id":142284,"name":{"full":"Gouichi Iwahata"}},"role":"Prop Design"},{"node":{"id":144481,"name":{"full":"Noritaka Suzuki"}},"role":"Prop Design"},{"node":{"id":144948,"name":{"full":"Ryouka Kinoshita"}},"role":"Art Director"},{"node":{"id":142605,"name":{"full":"Kaoru Aoki"}},"role":"Art Design"},{"node":{"id":134288,"name":{"full":"Izumi Sakamoto "}},"role":"Color Design"},{"node":{"id":156710,"name":{"full":"Kaori Miyagi"}},"role":"Director of Photography"},{"node":{"id":142612,"name":{"full":"Hitomi Sudou"}},"role":"Editing"},{"node":{"id":177283,"name":{"full":"Kentarou Iijima"}},"role":"CG Director"},{"node":{"id":103074,"name":{"full":"Jin Aketagawa"}},"role":"Sound Director"},{"node":{"id":142291,"name":{"full":"Yuuji Furuya"}},"role":"Sound Effects"},{"node":{"id":119975,"name":{"full":"Kenichirou Suehiro"}},"role":"Music"},{"node":{"id":124675,"name":{"f