 to be comparable to the Ancient Weapons of old, the Marines’ trump card, the “Dyna Stones,” have suddenly been stolen by a group of renegade vigilantes. The terrifyingly powerful man responsible, former Marine Admiral “Z”, now stands in the path of Luffy and his Straw Hat Pirates. Can the Straw Hats defeat “Z” and his crew, or will the New World meet its end at the hands of this mad man? \u003cbr\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: Funimation)","duration":107,"endDate":{"day":15,"month":12,"year":2012},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama"],"id":12859,"idMal":12859,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":79,"season":"FALL","seasonYear":2012,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/12859","startDate":{"day":15,"month":12,"year":2012},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Film 12: Z","海贼王剧场版Z","One Piece Gold - Il film"],"title":{"english":"One Piece Film: Z","native":"ONE PIECE FILM Z","romaji":"ONE PIECE FILM: Z","userPreferred":"One Piece Film: Z"},"trailer":{"id":"1gGt1Mg_zSo","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/1gGt1Mg_zSo/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/21335-ps20iVSGUXbD.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1bb35","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/nx21335-XsXdE0AeOkkZ.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/nx21335-XsXdE0AeOkkZ.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/nx21335-XsXdE0AeOkkZ.jpg"},"description":"In One Piece Film Gold, The Straw Hats are at it again in an all-new high-flying adventure! A gripping tale unfolds in the spectacular city of Gran Tesoro, where Luffy and his crew are drawn by dreams of hitting the jackpot. With so much luck, Luffy's winning streak can't possibly end. But behind the gilded curtains lies a powerful king whose deep pockets and deeper ambitions spell disaster for all.\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: FUNimation)","duration":120,"endDate":{"day":23,"month":7,"year":2016},"episodes":1,"format":"MOVIE","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Drama","Fantasy"],"id":21335,"idMal":31490,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":77,"season":"SUMMER","seasonYear":2016,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/anime/21335","startDate":{"day":23,"month":7,"year":2016},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["One Piece Film 13","航海王之黄金城"],"title":{"english":"One Piece Film: Gold","native":"ONE PIECE FILM GOLD","romaji":"ONE PIECE FILM: GOLD","userPreferred":"One Piece Film: Gold"},"trailer":{"id":"_shEgcWHC2U","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_shEgcWHC2U/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"ANIME"},"relationType":"SIDE_STORY"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/n96427-UsjDRx1o4V8V.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#e4861a","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx96427-XiDc44cTlf29.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/bx96427-XiDc44cTlf29.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/small/bx96427-XiDc44cTlf29.png"},"description":"One Piece: Loguetown Arc is a novelization of Eiichiro Oda's intended story elements for the Loguetown Arc, later used in the anime as a filler (Episodes 50-51).\n","endDate":{},"format":"NOVEL","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":96427,"idMal":94534,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":76,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/manga/96427","startDate":{"day":17,"month":7,"year":2000},"status":"FINISHED","synonyms":["ONE PIECE: Loguetown Arc","Logue Town"],"title":{"native":"ONE PIECE ローグタウン編","romaji":"ONE PIECE: Loguetown-hen","userPreferred":"ONE PIECE: Loguetown-hen"},"type":"MANGA"},"relationType":"SOURCE"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/banner/30013-hbbRZqC5MjYh.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#f1935d","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/large/bx30013-BeslEMqiPhlk.jpg","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/medium/bx30013-BeslEMqiPhlk.jpg","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/manga/cover/small/bx30013-BeslEMqiPhlk.jpg"},"description":"As a child, Monkey D. Luffy was inspired to become a pirate by listening to the tales of the buccaneer \"Red-Haired\" Shanks. But his life changed when Luffy accidentally ate the Gum-Gum Devil Fruit and gained the power to stretch like rubber...at the cost of never being able to swim again! Years later, still vowing to become the king of the pirates, Luffy sets out on his adventure...one guy alone in a rowboat, in search of the legendary \"One Piece,\" said to be the greatest treasure in the world...\n\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n(Source: VIZ Media)","endDate":{},"format":"MANGA","genres":["Action","Adventure","Comedy","Fantasy"],"id":30013,"idMal":13,"isAdult":false,"meanScore":91,"siteUrl":"https://anilist.co/manga/30013","startDate":{"day":22,"month":7,"year":1997},"status":"RELEASING","synonyms":["원피스","וואן פיס ","One Piece - Большой куш","ワンピース","ONE PIECE～航海王～","วันพีซ"],"title":{"english":"One Piece","native":"ONE PIECE","romaji":"ONE PIECE","userPreferred":"One Piece"},"trailer":{"id":"q1hfLa75hRs","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/q1hfLa75hRs/hqdefault.jpg"},"type":"MANGA"},"relationType":"SOURCE"},{"node":{"bannerImage":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/101918-jUG4Mb1hCxVS.jpg","countryOfOrigin":"JP","coverImage":{"color":"#5dc9f1","extraLarge":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx101918-3uyCYHw1syki.png","large":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/medium/bx101918-3uyCYHw1syki.png","medium":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/small/bx101918-3uyCYHw1syki.png"},"description":"The special will be the first in the \"